Please note that the evidence folder for PM03 has been split into multiple word documents.
Reason for this is because it is how the testbook for PM03 what it laid out.
Check file name will have a list of what activity screenshots are included in them.

- api-data-displayed
Contains activity Practical Skill 10: Suggested API Practical: Display Data from an API.

- console-debugging
This file contains screenshots when orginal code provided for the Activity did not work and needed to be debugged to completed the activity.
Contains the following activities Practical Skill 2: Debugging with Console and Browser Developer Tools, Practical Skill 4: DOM Manipulation, Practical Skill 5: Events, Practical Skill 6: Form Validation.

- Ryan Ward PM-03
Contains the following activities Tools, Files and Project Setup, Practical Skill 3: Error hand with try…catch, Practical Skill 4: DOM Manipulation, Practical Skill 5: Events, Practical Skill 6: Form Validation, Main Practical Build: Department Contact Form with Validation, Practical Skill 11: Light Animation and Multimedia Awareness.
 
- validation-error
This file contains screenshots the code was put in but errors would appear. 
Contains the following Practical Skill 1: Reading Error Messages, Practical Skill 4: DOM Manipulation, Practical Skill 5: Events.

- validation-success
This file contains the screenshot after the code has been debugged and webpage now responded successfully. Contains the following Practical Skill 1: Reading Error Messages, Practical Skill 4: DOM Manipulation, Practical Skill 5: Events, Practical Skill 6: Form Validation